---
title "Install JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (intent playbook)"
---

= Install JetBrains Mono Nerd Font

Glyph layer for CLI icons. Patches JetBrains Mono; does not replace Appearance's unpatched JetBrains Mono unless you choose it in the host terminal.

Same file on every OS. PlayTime binds `cli.install` for tool `nerd-fonts-jetbrains-mono`.

::: playbook [id="install-nerd-fonts-jetbrains-mono" shell="auto"]

::: choose [id="pkg-format" prompt="How should we install JetBrains Mono Nerd Font?" intent="cli.install" tool="nerd-fonts-jetbrains-mono"]
:::

::: step [id="install" intent="cli.install" tool="nerd-fonts-jetbrains-mono" bind="pkg-format" confirm=true]
:::

:::
